    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world shrouded by chaos, the Blademancers stand as the last line of hope. Warriors forged through hardship, honed by discipline, and bound by an unbreakable oath to defend the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chosen from birth and shaped into a living weapon, you have trained for this moment your entire life. Now, as darkness rises once more, your ultimate test begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the world lies in your hands. Will you rally those who still believe in the light, or will you walk a darker path and carve your own legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your companions and let your blade decide the destiny of the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495740/extras/73ca006b0ddf715d0533c342141149cc.poster.avif?t=1749578855\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495740/extras/73ca006b0ddf715d0533c342141149cc.webm?t=1749578855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495740/extras/73ca006b0ddf715d0533c342141149cc.mp4?t=1749578855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>KEY FEATURES</u></strong><br><br> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in brutal, blood-soaked battles where every action matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every encounter ends in violence\u2014decide the fate of those you meet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape the world and determine how it reacts to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an atmospheric soundtrack blending dungeon synth and heavy metal.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master sacred Blademancer arts, fusing devastating swordplay with powerful magic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495740/extras/8561796bba16886716e9ad69319bd812.poster.avif?t=1749578855\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495740/extras/8561796bba16886716e9ad69319bd812.webm?t=1749578855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495740/extras/8561796bba16886716e9ad69319bd812.mp4?t=1749578855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world shrouded by chaos, the Blademancers stand as the last line of hope. Warriors forged through hardship, honed by discipline, and bound by an unbreakable oath to defend the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chosen from birth and shaped into a living weapon, you have trained for this moment your entire life. Now, as darkness rises once more, your ultimate test begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the world lies in your hands. Will you rally those who still believe in the light, or will you walk a darker path and carve your own legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your companions and let your blade decide the destiny of the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495740/extras/73ca006b0ddf715d0533c342141149cc.poster.avif?t=1749578855\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495740/extras/73ca006b0ddf715d0533c342141149cc.webm?t=1749578855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495740/extras/73ca006b0ddf715d0533c342141149cc.mp4?t=1749578855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>KEY FEATURES</u></strong><br><br> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in brutal, blood-soaked battles where every action matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every encounter ends in violence\u2014decide the fate of those you meet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape the world and determine how it reacts to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an atmospheric soundtrack blending dungeon synth and heavy metal.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master sacred Blademancer arts, fusing devastating swordplay with powerful magic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495740/extras/8561796bba16886716e9ad69319bd812.poster.avif?t=1749578855\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495740/extras/8561796bba16886716e9ad69319bd812.webm?t=1749578855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495740/extras/8561796bba16886716e9ad69319bd812.mp4?t=1749578855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
